        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Explore the \"**Beltrame Gallery**\" in VR, a digital transposition of the permanent exhibition of **Achille Beltrame in Arzignano**.\n\nImmerse yourself in his fascinating illustrations for the **Domenica del Corriere**, while the warm voice of **Beltrame** accompanies you with personal stories and inspirations.\n\nBesides the educational aspect, the app offers an **engaging experience**, allowing you to explore the works in an **interactive** way and appreciate the **artistic skill** of Beltrame.\n\nWhether you are an art enthusiast or simply curious about Italian history, this journey will satisfy your thirst for **knowledge** and **emotions**.",
